{start_of_bridge}
In [A]death, in [E]life, I'm confident and [B]covered by the [C#m]pow'r of Your great love.
My [A]debt is paid; [E]There's nothing that can [B]separate my [C#m]heart from Your great love.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
